are, and opportunity.", "children": [{"id": "d537328f-45e4-4743-be90-0547539568bf", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Institutional analysis", "children": [{"id": "ba6b7e96-ed31-432c-8d74-d44a12a87ba1", "type": "concept", "title": "Education"}, {"id": "314b4b2e-712e-4694-845e-b527caf5df40", "type": "concept", "title": "Health care"}, {"id": "e6797674-bc42-4b93-ad5d-09167bdf9146", "type": "concept", "title": "Criminal legal system"}, {"id": "b88a32e8-3e89-4efd-af01-9db38e2d2bc3", "type": "concept", "title": "Labor and welfare systems"}], "description": "Institutions shape behavior by setting rules, norms, resources, and sanctions."}, {"id": "3f632714-e9bc-427a-9d07-b57779d0aea8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Life chances and cumulative advantage", "children": [{"id": "52271be7-1818-4c23-a728-b99d1d75926b", "type": "concept", "title": "Cumulative inequality"}, {"id": "c3ca659f-8714-4e37-8528-6e64bf39ff68", "type": "concept", "title": "Intergenerational mobility"}, {"id": "ecf79e7a-d25d-4719-9a9f-b423048c7cae", "type": "concept", "title": "Credentialing and exclusion"}, {"id": "9e612063-3947-47f5-927b-f027fc3e065a", "type": "concept", "title": "Policy-mediated opportunity"}], "description": "Students connect structural position to cumulative opportunity and cumulative harm."}, {"id": "c2c58c48-5316-4a24-9be2-76a2696c5f12", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Institutional trust and harm", "children": [{"id": "00e69056-4af3-4bd7-825a-2d47e816524c", "type": "concept", "title": "Medical mistrust"}, {"id": "76313bed-f41f-48e5-93b2-4565ac60165c", "type": "concept", "title": "School discipline"}, {"id": "9f4f5230-54e6-417e-bf53-a689a6479435", "type": "concept", "title": "Child welfare surveillance"}, {"id": "6f8f9abb-d620-43f8-a907-e33de4ab7f6f", "type": "concept", "title": "Community-police relationships"}], "description": "People's relationships to institutions reflect both help and histories of surveillance, exclusion, and violence."}]}, {"id": "7a7777c3-30c5-473a-9f31-33593f94aa3