ice links critical analysis to accountable action."}]}, {"id": "80d30447-5ead-44cb-995e-8ac86415dbab", "type": "topic", "title": "Culture, Race, Ethnicity, Migration, and Belonging", "description": "Study culture and identity as dynamic social processes shaped by history, migration, racialization, language, and belonging.", "children": [{"id": "2f060431-371f-4af9-9994-3feb9577ea0a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Culture as dynamic context", "children": [{"id": "e19d3519-29ef-44e0-a75e-617e57bb5842", "type": "concept", "title": "Cultural humility"}, {"id": "92d69402-9e27-4df8-a231-0b582f97a65d", "type": "concept", "title": "Language and communication"}, {"id": "adbb7c41-f5f3-423a-be2f-bd8aeec4f860", "type": "concept", "title": "Religion and spirituality"}, {"id": "c6d6ecf2-9f1b-4799-9b15-5b90340f086d", "type": "concept", "title": "Cultural adaptation"}], "description": "Culture shapes meaning, identity, family life, help-seeking, and interpretation of behavior."}, {"id": "0996a733-40ed-4d82-b193-eec532947663", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Race, ethnicity, and racialization", "children": [{"id": "cd5c7cec-5525-49bf-92ac-417cc522752c", "type": "concept", "title": "Racial identity"}, {"id": "70d48863-d1f3-443c-8945-b609ee4be1ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Ethnic identity"}, {"id": "0f623ba9-fba1-49ee-80be-cec5ac30ebe8", "type": "concept", "title": "Racialization"}, {"id": "b7f3a068-6bed-484b-884a-825aa2b0e9b5", "type": "concept", "title": "Colorism and intra-group diversity"}], "description": "Race and ethnicity are lived through identity, community, institutions, and histories of power."}, {"id": "d597ffab-199c-4681-a27d-73191c39da51", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Migration and belonging", "children": [{"id": "3c9ebfc8-1026-4d10-994b-fdf615d62816", "type": "concept", "title": "Immigration status"}, {"id": "c6aa1451-e641-4435-b0db-613ec6bd1e10", "type": "concept", "title": "Refugee experience"}, {"id": "f5c1ef3b-35e0-4bd6-9f64-7e23d4b65ba6", "type": "concept", "title": "Transnational family ties"}, {"id": "938b949c-cc83-47c9-8ecf-745e072ca65b", "type": "concept", "title": "Acculturation and belonging"}], "description": "Migration changes family systems, community ties, legal vulnerability, and identity formation."}]}, {"id": "98c74c70-f698-42b6-929b-69197cca4715", "type": "topic", "title": "Social and Economic Inequality", "description": "Connect poverty, wealth, labor, housing, education, health, and policy to human behavior and social functioning.", "children": [{"id": "ece00537-0021-4a0d-af02-66caaf620d53", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Poverty and economic insecurity", "children": [{"id": "094b25f9-60aa-48b9-b967-a65e3dd90f00", "type": "concept", "title": "Income and wealth gaps"}, {"id": "e38a2457-f8c8-4e0a-816e-adc6c662ef1f", "type": "concept", "title": "Benefits cliffs"}, {"id": "7aec3234-bd24-4244-94af-7d1fee23137c", "type": "concept", "title": "Food and housing insecurity"}, {"id": "d4e9788a-5620-4be0-afb0-7c388e525246", "type": "concept", "title": "Debt and financial precarity"}], "description": "Economic inequality shapes behavior through stress, constrained choice, stigma, and material hardship."}, {"id": "88a9cf09-6f2c-4f1a-bb97-f2b33cd6a400", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Housing, education, health, and labor", "children": [{"id": "cc1238d4-3145-4014-b9c3-939e60455f79", "type": "concept", "title": "Housing markets"}, {"id": "e98b333c-cc7f-479d-b8aa-19c4dc134f42", "type": "concept", "title": "School funding and discipline"}, {"id": "3b699c11-d214-48f3-824e-b468929af1e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Health inequities"}, {"id": "b4136267-2604-400b-9cf8-b8bd957726e0", "type": "concept", "title": "Labor market segmentation"}], "description": "Major social institutions distribute resources and risks in deeply unequal ways."}, {"id": "b7f342a7-fc11-49be-b94a-31f128bac95c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Policy and inequality", "children": [{"id": "db2c44e8-68a2-4dd2-8ea1-12aaae48ac00", "type": "concept", "title": "Tax 