ence, displacement, racism, colonization, and disaster."}, {"id": "b4e07240-c154-4a8c-8f4f-5392c797166a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Collective resilience and healing", "children": [{"id": "72cfeb34-2aa3-456c-9955-de214fe65884", "type": "concept", "title": "Cultural resilience"}, {"id": "745dca13-c69f-4b44-b99f-5791830de503", "type": "concept", "title": "Mutual aid"}, {"id": "33a5480c-c99f-4c55-af23-f0a5f8be0d1d", "type": "concept", "title": "Community healing practices"}, {"id": "90d6bc77-cbb0-424d-896b-b2de286b3bec", "type": "concept", "title": "Trauma-informed organizations"}], "description": "Communities also produce healing, identity, resistance, care, and recovery."}]}, {"id": "4ef7ef6f-ab76-44b4-bd4f-4f8b37bdc03e", "type": "topic", "title": "Globalization, Transnational Families, and Global Social Systems", "description": "Analyze how global migration, labor, climate, conflict, coloniality, and policy shape local social work realities.", "children": [{"id": "b1ef66ee-12e3-4914-9ce5-fd1ce736ecd0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Globalization and social work", "children": [{"id": "208d9c9f-e64d-4fd5-b2fe-dee1a204d7da", "type": "concept", "title": "Global labor"}, {"id": "549b30a8-8b89-4091-8d05-464fa3427160", "type": "concept", "title": "Trade and austerity"}, {"id": "2ebe6673-d5af-42bc-a57e-dd3b8c53ef42", "type": "concept", "title": "Global care chains"}, {"id": "32ce9140-f805-4399-adf5-5b04b7af067a", "type": "concept", "title": "International social policy"}], "description": "Global forces shape local work through labor markets, migration, policy, conflict, and climate."}, {"id": "04f4d987-dd63-4cc7-9799-0b7a71050cd2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Transnational families", "children": [{"id": "47e46f19-c12a-48fc-9400-58fa5ffaa6f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Remittances"}, {"id": "aab7620f-5498-498e-809d-7ac781f8fea0", "type": "concept", "title": "Separated families"}, {"id": "117192dc-6f33-4633-a188-70f822850e82", "type": "concept", "title": "Mixed-status families"}, {"id": "9e9b8b74-168d-48c6-9fb8-289a75892b32", "type": "concept", "title": "Cross-border caregiving"}], "description": "Families often maintain caregiving, identity, obligation, and belonging across borders."}, {"id": "40064577-8cbb-4f42-ab48-6394cf060b8f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Global justice and decolonial perspectives", "children": [{"id": "1219da06-498a-443d-928c-4cfd9be5714d", "type": "concept", "title": "Coloniality"}, {"id": "e87d93e9-8d4c-4670-8e27-4330ec970761", "type": "concept", "title": "Human rights frameworks"}, {"id": "16d4dfd3-1339-48ae-9aa8-bac786c4dfce", "type": "concept", "title": "Indigenous sovereignty"}, {"id": "f384c99c-e062-4210-ad19-3e688f58ddaa", "type": "concept", "title": "Climate justice"}], "description": "Students examine social systems through colonial history, human rights, and global inequality."}]}, {"id": "3abb7ca4-5194-4911-b10a-a950a1c94e42", "type": "topic", "title": "Macro-Level Assessment: Community, Organization, and Policy Analysis", "description": "Practice structured assessment tools for understanding organizations, communities, institutions, and policy environments.", "children": [{"id": "f16f798d-6d00-4914-941e-1f073ae2bc5a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Community assessment", "children": [{"id": "21765d11-6809-40c8-a7ad-b8ee35e146b0", "type": "concept", "title": "Asset mapping"}, {"id": "6c9f98f3-ffaa-43d3-a15c-0113542fb245", "type": "concept", "title": "Needs assessment"}, {"id": "a2093ed6-248e-4ceb-8b76-a715652e84d3", "type": "concept", "title": "Stakeholder analysis"}, {"id": "d13e632d-2e1c-4f16-ab94-ebacf6fdceb5", "type": "concept", "title": "Community data and listening sessions"}], "description": "Community assessment identifies assets, needs, power, history, and possibilities for change."}, {"id": "e283ba01-69b2-46a6-bea2-49b4725d8edb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Organizational assessment", "children": [{"id": "f2a8d967-aaa9-4daa-84f7-eb56bb45a917", "type": "concept", "title": "Mission 