, intervention, and expected outcomes."}, {"id": "a18ad4cd-843e-449e-91f6-b823e6ccf729", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Advocacy and coalition practice", "children": [{"id": "09fc0ec5-68d4-4e81-b40f-e26c0cf84602", "type": "concept", "title": "Coalition building"}, {"id": "45568f51-7708-4853-915e-6947c551b259", "type": "concept", "title": "Power mapping"}, {"id": "7bb7db5f-ca3f-4f3d-b40a-f3a9e70859e2", "type": "concept", "title": "Legislative advocacy"}, {"id": "7addaba2-1b47-426f-a855-f8350ab42167", "type": "concept", "title": "Media and narrative strategy"}], "description": "Systems change requires relationships, shared strategy, and political skill."}, {"id": "1491dff3-8d35-4a50-933f-0667540546cc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Leadership and implementation", "children": [{"id": "a50a4eda-67c8-46d7-add4-ff386c6ec4cd", "type": "concept", "title": "Adaptive leadership"}, {"id": "0db8ea1c-29df-4065-b78d-da20c6fd2987", "type": "concept", "title": "Implementation barriers"}, {"id": "9ef496e3-b246-439b-81e7-7a1611af3935", "type": "concept", "title": "Participatory decision-making"}, {"id": "78c4ce3e-c168-4bfe-a459-e0acf2dc3a96", "type": "concept", "title": "Evaluation for improvement"}], "description": "Leadership in social work is relational, ethical, adaptive, and accountable."}]}, {"id": "055142e5-7c8f-4728-bafb-cd6fa4661202", "type": "topic", "title": "Integrative HBSE II Case Lab and Social Environment Map", "description": "Apply the full course by creating a multi-level person-in-environment analysis and change strategy for a complex case or community issue.", "children": [{"id": "824a6fb8-7ea8-402b-807f-a59145ee2425", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Multi-level case mapping", "children": [{"id": "053bf8d8-80ed-4041-9793-7f5d683c583d", "type": "concept", "title": "Eco-map"}, {"id": "26b50a95-03ca-4195-bc40-5f898d86567c", "type": "concept", "title": "Genogram extension"}, {"id": "cd5ec203-f338-4ee8-9db5-c4b7a1bd6c86", "type": "concept", "title": "Organizational map"},